meta {
  name: analyze a run digest (NDJSON stream)
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/analyze
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "digest": "run digest\nprompt: say OK",
    "lang": "en"
  }
}

docs {
  Opt-in one-shot LLM reading of an imported run's digest, streamed as NDJSON ({meta:{provider,model,address}}, {delta}..., {done}|{error}). Reasoning is refused (the translate lesson); an empty answer is an error, not a done. 400 blank, 413 oversize, 503 provider not ready or provider-is-local (card 294).
  
  Body: AnalyzeBody(String digest, String lang) — digest required, max 60000 chars; lang en | de.
  
  CAUTION: Spends the operator's API key on every call.
  
  Fence: host+origin+json — Loopback fence plus Origin check, and the request must carry Content-Type: application/json — anything else is 415.
  
  Writes state: no
}
